 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Skill? Nee Yo Sonna mon! ~Fuguusha-tachi no Sainou Kaika~"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "スキル？ ねぇよそんなもん！ ～不遇者たちの才能開花～ コミック版"
   },
   {
    "en": "Skills? There's No Such Thing!: The Blossoming of the Talents of the Underprivileged"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Hikaru Kajikawa, who spent his days aimlessly, suddenly wakes up in a strange forest in another world. However, he possesses no skills or special abilities and is attacked by dangerous monsters. With the help of Almatina, a knight in training, he manages to reach a human village. However, both he and Alma have rather disreputable \"jobs\", and they become the target of ridicule from other adventurers. Nevertheless, Hikaru, who has since learned to manipulate his magical powers, evolves alongside Alma in an unorthodox way.",
   "ja": "仮眠から目覚めたら何故か異世界にいた主人公・梶川光流。状況から自分が異世界にいることを理解した光流は、「自分もゲームや漫画のようにチートでウハウハ…」と夢見たのも束の間、確認したステータスはスキルなし＆能力値オール0！？さらに魔物に襲われてピンチ！そんなところを救ってくれたのは【見習いパラディン】の少女アルマティナ。しかし聞けば彼女は、不遇職だと周囲からバカにされている様子。ステータス0に不遇職という不遇コンビ…しかし光流の何気ない発想で徐々に2人は常識外れの強さを身につけはじめ――？"
  },
